Game Boy for BuzzOS

This application uses the MIT-licensed binjgb emulator core and supports
original Game Boy (DMG) and Game Boy Color (CGB) ROMs. Game data is not included.

Place a legally obtained .gb ROM in /fs/games/gameboy/. The emulator opens
game.gb first, or otherwise the first .gb file it finds. Battery-backed
cartridge RAM is saved by ROM name in /fs/games/gameboy/ as a .sav file.

Controls:
  Arrow keys  D-pad
  Z           B
  X           A
  Enter       Start
  Backspace   Select
Maximize the window from the desktop to play full-screen. Game audio uses the
BuzzOS AC97 PCM driver.
